  "ud3.9:2.14": "gaṇanasippaṃ sippānaṃ aggan ti. ",
  "ud3.9:2.15": "ekacce evam āhaṃsu: ",
  "ud3.9:2.16": "saṅkhānasippaṃ sippānaṃ aggan ti. ",
  "ud3.9:2.17": "ekacce evam āhaṃsu: ",
  "ud3.9:2.18": "lekhāsippaṃ sippānaṃ aggan ti. ",
  "ud3.9:2.19": "ekacce evam āhaṃsu: ",
  "ud3.9:2.20": "kāveyyasippaṃ sippānaṃ aggan ti. ",
  "ud3.9:2.21": "ekacce evam āhaṃsu: ",
  "ud3.9:2.22": "lokāyatasippaṃ sippānaṃ aggan ti. ",
  "ud3.9:2.23": "ekacce evam āhaṃsu: ",
  "ud3.9:2.24": "khettavijjāsippaṃ sippānaṃ aggan ti. ",
  "ud3.9:2.25": "ayañ carahi tesaṃ bhikkhūnaṃ antarākathā vippakatā. ",
  "ud3.9:3.1": "atha kho bhagavā sāyaṇhasamayam . . . ",
  "ud3.9:3.2": "",
  "ud3.9:3.3": "pe . . . (comp. III.8) vippakatā 'ti. ",
  "ud3.9:4.1": "idha bhante . . . pe . . . (as before) udapādi: ",
  "ud3.9:4.2": "ko nu kho āvuso sippaṃ jānāti . . . ",
  "ud3.9:4.3": "pe . . . khettavijjāsippaṃ ",
