  "ud3.9:5.24": "aggan ti. ",
  "ud3.9:5.25": "ayaṃ kho no bhante antarākathā vippakatā. atha kho bhagavā anuppatto 'ti. ",
  "ud3.9:6.1": "na khv etaṃ . . . . . . ",
  "ud3.9:6.2": "",
  "ud3.9:6.3": "pe . . . (comp. III.8) tuṇhibhāvo 'ti. ",
  "ud3.9:7.1": "atha kho bhagavā etaṃ atthaṃ viditvā tāyaṃ velāyaṃ imaṃ udānaṃ udānesu: ",
  "ud3.9:8.1": "asippajīvī lahu atthakāmo ",
  "ud3.9:8.2": "yatindriyo sabbadhivippamutto ",
  "ud3.9:8.3": "anokasārī amamo nirāso ",
  "ud3.9:8.4": "hatvā mānaṃ ekacaro sa bhikkhū ",
